    "innovation": "This paper presents a large-scale analysis of the rain-snow temperature threshold across the Northern Hemisphere, revealing significant spatial variability and demonstrating that incorporating humidity alongside air temperature substantially improves the prediction of precipitation phase in land surface models.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
