            "target_entity_type": "Resolution",
            "paragraph": "We therefore used the 1980-2007 average wintertime (December-January-February) Ps from the Modern-Era Retrospective analysis for Research and Applications version 2 (MERRA-2) reanalysis dataset 63,64 for the grid cell (0.5\u00b0 latitude X 0.625\u00b0 longitude) in which the station observation was located.",
