            "target_entity_instance": "2 m Ts",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "To construct a spatially continuous 50% rain-snow Ts threshold product across the Northern Hemisphere, we applied the optimized bivariate model to the MERRA-2 gridded reanalysis dataset 63,64. Hourly 2 m Ts, specific humidity (q), Ps, and precipitation data were accessed from 1980 through 2007 and summarized to a daily time step.",
