            "paragraph": "In this study, we analyzed observations from the National Center for Environmental Prediction (NCEP) Automated Data Processing (ADP) Operational Global Surface Observations dataset (DS464.0), hosted by the National Center for Atmospheric Research (http://rda.ucar.edu/datasets/ds464.0/). This dataset includes 6- and 3-hourly synoptic weather reports with measurements of Ts, dew point temperature (Td), and Ps (collected at ~1.5-2.0 m above ground), as well as visual observer reports of precipitation phase from meteorological stations across the globe for the period 1978-01-01 through 2007-02-25.",
